#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068568 :question/id #uuid "daf5cc74-4c7d-500a-9345-03bd6b73a333" :question/math-academy-id "e-465" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $$\n\\displaystyle\\int 5 \\csc {\\left(6x+\\dfrac \\pi 3\\right)} \\cot {\\left(6x+\\dfrac \\pi 3\\right)} \\,  \\textrm{d}x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If we let $u=6x+\\dfrac \\pi 3,$ then\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d u}{\\textrm d x} = 6\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\textrm d x =\\dfrac 1 6\\, \\textrm d u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 5\\operatorname{csc}⁡(6x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\operatorname{cot}⁡(6x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\,\\text{d}x & =5\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡(6x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\operatorname{cot}⁡(6x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡u\\operatorname{cot}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{6}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{6}\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡u\\operatorname{cot}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{6}\\operatorname{csc}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{6}\\operatorname{csc}⁡(6x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "084eb4cc-2f84-5288-90a6-be84066922b6" :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186677458 :question-generator/id #uuid "092320c1-1e35-58d7-8ea9-25a4a1fad602" :question-generator/script "generators/30/30f100bda0c31ad5015006fa6f8561f9bcb0b5857aaea07f066124ec6b556c2e/generator.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186069004 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00a40602-52d1-5dc9-8e31-c35464767acf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{7}\\operatorname{sec}⁡(7x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186235799} {:answer/id #uuid "3eec2768-c2bf-5731-b512-c6df48d8bb5c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sec}⁡(7x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236217} {:answer/id #uuid "4e578f69-909a-523b